# Line endings for the demo materials.
#
# In the team repository this file sits at docs/demo/.gitattributes.
#
# frontend/.gitattributes cannot cover this directory. A .gitattributes governs
# only its own tree, so without this file `git ls-files --eol` reports an empty
# attr/ column for RECOVERY.md and INTEGRATION.md, and their line endings are a
# property of whoever staged them rather than of the repository.
#
# The team root .gitattributes carries the same rule and would make this file
# redundant, but main does not have that file yet.
* text=auto eol=lf
